            <div xml:id="d702">

                <pb facs="0820" n="810" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg810"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.633/1–2348: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Consul General at Mukden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Ward</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-01-23T18:00:00-05:00">January 23, 1948—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>16. Embassy Nanking has authority evacuate American and alien employees their
                    families and effects place safety. Therefore all personnel changes for
                    evacuation purposes should be authorized by Embassy and it will keep Dept
                    informed. Urom<anchor n="4" xml:id="d702-f1"/> Dec 30 re Teiichiro Tani.<anchor
                        n="5" xml:id="d702-f2"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
